92
00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:13.110
He did.

93
00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:14.810
He said, I only have one gear.

94
00:04:15.030 --> 00:04:15.790
You got to hear this.

95
00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:16.850
This is a tangent.

96
00:04:17.010 --> 00:04:18.590
But that's what this is making me think of.

97
00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:20.950
This talk about dinner parties gone wrong.

98
00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:21.830
This kind of vibe.

99
