00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:14.600
I do.

125
00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:18.280
I will say, like, it took a dumpscape not and you never took your foot off the gas.

126
00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:18.880
No, I was.

127
00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:21.520
We all knew it wasn't going to go to air.

128
00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:23.220
We're like, look at Jack trying his hardeSt.

129
00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:26.000
I've only got one gear.

130
00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:27.920
As anyone who knows, who knows.

