230
00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:17.780
I was on the floor laughing and really felt like it was going to be so much fun.

231
00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:20.540
I just couldn't wait to sink my teeth into it.

232
00:11:20.540 --> 00:11:29.320
It just felt like, you know, all of the wonderful, unhealthy, and completely dysfunctional elements

233
00:11:29.320 --> 00:11:32.920
