234
00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:36.300
And I couldn't really wait to dive in and get going.

235
00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:43.640
Angela, Gene told me that during the table read of this, he sweated through his shirt.

236
00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:52.360
He said, it started off a little quiet because the episode is pretty dark, but that by the end,

237
00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:58.980
when the cop says, not now, Dwight, the whole room just erupted into laughter.

238
00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:05.640
And afterwards, Greg Daniels came up to him and Lee and said, this script was perfect.

239
00:12:05.640 --> 00:12:06.160
Wow.

240
00:12:07.780 --> 00:12:14.260
So Gene reminded me that before he and Lee got their jobs on the office, Gene had been

241
00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:20.060
working part-time as Harold Ramis' nanny, and Lee was a temp at HBO.

242
00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:23.720
