Office Ladies was mixed and mastered by Bill Schultz.

1910
01:45:09.460 --> 01:45:12.220
Our theme song is Rubber Tree by Creed Bratton.

1911
01:45:12.220 --> 01:45:12.640
We'll be right back.

1912
01:45:12.660 --> 01:45:12.760
Thank you.
